WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.096 --> 00:00:04.021
A function is a named job. Making it does not run it.

2
00:00:04.274 --> 00:00:07.274
A call block runs it, once for each call.

3
00:00:07.528 --> 00:00:12.428
speed is a parameter. spawn enemy 50 makes speed fifty inside.

4
00:00:12.681 --> 00:00:15.206
So each call can make a different bug.
